    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d630">

                <pb facs="0928" n="800" xml:id="pg800"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./189:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-24T17:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 24,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>147. MacGregor, representative Pan American Airways, informs me he signed today
                    with Honduranean Government a contract in terms substantially as proposed by the
                    company.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
